#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:35592
#: 6ce8877525d44b43936f59cfd8ee721a
msgid "1 byte bitmap of which EKF3 instances run an independent EKF\\-GSF yaw estimator to provide a backup yaw estimate that doesn\\'t rely on magnetometer data\\. This estimator uses IMU\\, GPS and\\, if available\\, airspeed data\\. EKF\\-GSF yaw estimator data for the primary EKF3 instance will be logged as GSF0 and GSF1 messages\\. Use of the yaw estimate generated by this algorithm is controlled by the EK3\\_GSF\\_USE\\_MASK and EK3\\_GSF\\_RST\\_MAX parameters\\. To run the EKF\\-GSF yaw estimator in ride\\-along and logging only\\, set EK3\\_GSF\\_USE to 0\\."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:35622
#: 6e270daecd6b4d1baf71428b6814778c
msgid "EK3\\_GSF\\_USE\\_MASK: Bitmask of which EKF\\-GSF yaw estimators are used"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:35627
#: 1ce4d54058bd4f928afa7fb86ae1fd4c
msgid "A bitmask of which EKF3 instances will use the output from the EKF\\-GSF yaw estimator that has been turned on by the EK3\\_GSF\\_RUN\\_MASK parameter\\. If the inertial navigation calculation stops following the GPS\\, then the vehicle code can request EKF3 to attempt to resolve the issue\\, either by performing a yaw reset if enabled by this parameter by switching to another EKF3 instance\\."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:35657
#: 7a8b7c5169534669be798162a2e862eb
msgid "EK3\\_GSF\\_RST\\_MAX: Maximum number of resets to the EKF\\-GSF yaw estimate allowed"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:35662
#: 5c9b4fb5ceb34a42bb69b2bd5fd21791
msgid "Sets the maximum number of times the EKF3 will be allowed to reset its yaw to the estimate from the EKF\\-GSF yaw estimator\\. No resets will be allowed unless the use of the EKF\\-GSF yaw estimate is enabled via the EK3\\_GSF\\_USE\\_MASK parameter\\."
msgstr ""

