#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:36423
#: 6d193826732445eeb4b0dc9a7cacc2e2
msgid "EKF Source Options\\. Bit 0\\: Fuse all velocity sources present in EK3\\_SRCx\\_VEL\\_\\. Bit 1\\: Align external navigation position when using optical flow\\. Bit 3\\: Use SRC per core\\. By default\\, EKF source selection is controlled via the EK3\\_SRC parameters\\, allowing only one source to be active at a time across all cores \\(switchable via MAVLink\\, Lua\\, or RC\\)\\. Enabling this bit maps EKF core 1 to SRC1\\, core 2 to SRC2\\, etc\\.\\, allowing each core to run independently with a dedicated source\\."
msgstr ""

